OL,3,GNEWSAElephant & Castle traders 'shut
OL,4,Aout' of new centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraders from the old Elephant & Castle
OL,7,Fshopping centre have said they have
OL,8,Fbeen shut out of the #500m town centre
OL,9,Fbuilt in its place.
OL,11,FThe Elephant opened to the public on 12
OL,12,FNovember, six years after the shopping
OL,13,Fcentre closed its doors for the last
OL,14,Ftime.
OL,16,FAccording to the charity Latin
OL,17,FElephant, more than 70 independent
OL,18,Fbusinesses were evicted in 2020 -
OL,19,FSouthwark Council said at the time that
OL,20,Fthey all could apply for affordable
OL,21,Fspace in the rebuilt centre.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
