OL,3,GNEWSAElephant & Castle traders 'shut
OL,4,Aout' of new centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe developer, Get Living, proposed
OL,7,Fjust 15 affordable units - which
OL,8,Ftraders said fell far short of what was
OL,9,Fpromised.
